{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid of Salvation is an action RPG focused on <strong>fast-paced combat</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features dynamic action built on <strong>the rhythm of swift battles</strong> and the <strong>creative combination</strong> of weapons and skills gained through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Fantasy of Maids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/9978822f0d1f7c18f4518c91543ea732.avif?t=1757480990\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Shizuka, a maid of purgatory, fights to bring salvation to lost souls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Entrusted with a special mission from the Sanctuary\u2019s Overseer, she crosses the portal into a Purgatory overrun by Fiends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yet as her journey unfolds, Shizuka begins to realize that the salvation she believed in\u2014and the truth of this world\u2014is far more twisted than she ever imagined...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>deep, satisfying combat</strong> through a diverse fighting style that blends swords, firearms, and special techniques with precise controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/51ab0a30382bc3d783dcd13fcfca992f.poster.avif?t=1757480990\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/51ab0a30382bc3d783dcd13fcfca992f.webm?t=1757480990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/51ab0a30382bc3d783dcd13fcfca992f.mp4?t=1757480990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>rich action</strong> that combines exploration and a wide array of skills, including dodging, guarding, parrying, surprise attacks, and chain-based moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/5dc183c36d3e97bb6b340e3f6d4bb3f0.poster.avif?t=1757480990\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/5dc183c36d3e97bb6b340e3f6d4bb3f0.webm?t=1757480990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/5dc183c36d3e97bb6b340e3f6d4bb3f0.mp4?t=1757480990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 20 powerful bosses. Make full use of the items and secret techniques you've acquired to approach each battle with <strong>strategic precision</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>quests</strong> and hidden boss encounters. Discover the unfolding stories of maids\u2014whether allies or rivals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/05a8831bf097aaa4ab2a84505574a8e5.avif?t=1757480990\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A finely crafted <strong>skill board system</strong> awaits you. Develop your character to match your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/extras/49068c843cb849eff13f4e53667d30d6.avif?t=1757480990\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721890?t=1757480990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/d50cca6615aaa5d2e50e238778773d2815c31e79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757480990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/4236439122d7578a3f6d4fa70c30c68019cdde1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757480990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721890/4236439122d7578a3f6d4fa70c30c68019cdde1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757480990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid of Salvation is an action RPG focused on <strong>fast-paced combat</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features dynamic action built on <strong>the rhythm of swift battles</strong> and the <strong>creative combination</strong> of weapons and skills gained through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Fantasy of Maids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b